  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "べつせかいから　あらわれた　ＵＢ。\nみずからの　からだを　みせつけてくるが\nじまんなのか　いかくなのか　ふめい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "다른 세계에서 나타난 UB이다.\n스스로 몸을 보여주는 행동이\n자랑인지 위협인지 알 수 없다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "來自另一個世界的ＵＢ。\n會主動向人展示自己的身體，\n但不知道是想要自豪還是威嚇。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Personne ne sait si cette Ultra-Chimère venue\nd’un autre monde montre ses muscles pour être\nadmirée ou pour intimider ceux qu’elle rencontre.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Eine Ultrabestie aus einer anderen Welt.\nNiemand weiß, ob sie ihren Körper aus Stolz\noder zur Abschreckung stählt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Ultraente procedente de otro mundo. Se\ndesconoce si exhibe su robusto cuerpo a modo\nde amenaza o para que lo admiren.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È un’Ultracreatura arrivata da un altro mondo.\nEsibisce i propri muscoli, ma non è chiaro se\nlo faccia per orgoglio o a scopo intimidatorio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Ultra Beast appeared from another world.\nIt shows off its body, but whether that display\nis a boast or a threat remains unclear.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "別世界から　現れた　ＵＢ。\n自らの　身体を　みせつけてくるが\n自慢なのか　いかくなのか　不明。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "从其他世界出现的究极异兽。\n会向人展现自己的身体，\n但不知道是出于自豪还是威吓。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Ultraente procedente de otro mundo. Se\ndesconoce si exhibe su robusto cuerpo a modo\nde amenaza o para que lo admiren.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "なぞの　せいぶつ　ＵＢ。　いっぱつの\nパンチで　ダンプカーを　ふんさいする\nこうけいが　もくげき　された。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "정체불명의 생물 UB. 한 방의\n펀치로 덤프트럭을 분쇄하는\n광경이 목격되었다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "謎一般的生物──ＵＢ。\n被目擊到了一拳把大卡車\n打得粉碎的情景。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "L’une des mystérieuses Ultra-Chimères.\nOn l’aurait aperçue réduisant un camion à benne\nen miettes d’un seul coup de poing.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Eine rätselhafte Ultrabestie, die angeblich mit\neinem einzigen Schlag einen beladenen Laster\npulverisieren kann.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Ultraente rodeado de misterio. Se le ha visto\nreducir a añicos un camión de un solo puñetazo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È una delle misteriose forme di vita note come\nUltracreature ed è stata vista ridurre in frantumi\nun camion con un solo pugno.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "A mysterious life-form called an Ultra Beast.\nWitnesses saw it pulverize a dump truck with a\nsingle punch.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "謎の　生物　ＵＢ。　一発の\nパンチで　ダンプカーを　粉砕する\n光景が　目撃　された。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "谜一般的生物究极异兽。\n被目击到了一拳把翻斗车\n打得粉碎的光景。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Ultraente rodeado de misterio. Se le ha visto\nreducir a añicos un camión de un solo puñetazo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "このせかいでは　いしつで　きけんだが\nほんらい　すんでいる　せかいでは\nふつうに　みかける　せいぶつらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "이 세계와는 성질이 다르고\n위험하지만 원래 살던 세계에서는\n흔히 볼 수 있는 생물인 듯하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在這個世界是危險的異類，\n但在原本棲息的世界裡，\n牠似乎是常見的普通生物。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cette créature venue d’ailleurs est dangereuse\ndans notre monde, mais il semblerait qu’elle soit\ntrès commune dans le sien.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In dieser Welt wirkt es gefährlich und\nfremdartig, doch in seiner ursprünglichen Welt\nist es ein ganz gewöhnliches Lebewesen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Para los seres de este mundo resulta extraño\ny peligroso, pero en el mundo del que procede\nes una criatura muy común.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nel nostro mondo il suo aspetto appare strano\ne minaccioso, ma sembra che in quello da cui\nproviene sia una creatura molto comune.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Although it’s alien to this world and a danger\nhere, it’s apparently a common organism in the\nworld where it normally lives.",
